  "One NavShell call: each destination is an icon, a label and its page; the bar, rail or drawer, the highlight and the page switch come with it",
  "Pages are plain columns of library components (ActivityRings in a sized box, GoalBar, ListItem, StatTile, BarChart): they scroll if taller than the window",
  "The form follows the width: bottom bar on the phone, rail at 640 and 800 wide, drawer with the app title at 1280"
 ],
